 "what_this_is": "The ONE registry of market-local execution zones. A path is MARKET_LOCAL_TOOLING only when it falls inside exactly one zone declared here AND scripts/pettripfinder/market_local_isolation.py proves all five isolation conditions for the change. Registering a zone grants nothing by itself: an unregistered path, a malformed entry, a path two zones claim, a shared write, a shared reverse import, an unresolved dynamic dependency or a registered (production-reachable) market all fail the proof and keep the path in its Regression V2 prefix class. This file is itself shared test infrastructure: a change to it blocks the narrowing for the whole change set that carries it.",
